{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.madoka.coffee",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她拿起桌上的咖啡",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.madoka.coffee",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.madoka.coffee",
    "idolId": "madoka",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯嗯——……好累……！",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "休息一下吧……",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "咦，刚才买的咖啡…………放哪儿了……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（开着的电视在说话。）",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，找到了找到了……",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……呼……",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哟！早上好，円香！",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……打招呼的话，我来的时候已经打过了。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "咦，抱歉……我没注意到……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……厨房里的东西，可以用吧？我想要这个。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "糖浆和牛奶？啊，可以啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "谢谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——円香？等等，那杯咖啡是……",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "是我的——",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "诶？",
            "nextNodeId": "130"
          },
          {
            "label": "等、円香！",
            "nextNodeId": "160"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "哈？这是我自己买的。盖子开着的吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是，可是我也……",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "啊，最近你常喝同一种呢。在哪里买的？",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……楼下的自动售货机。",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "是吗。我是在便利店买的……看看条形码那里。",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………………………便利店的标签……",
        "nextNodeId": "106"
      },
      "106": {
        "id": "106",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "难道说……你喝了？",
        "nextNodeId": "107"
      },
      "107": {
        "id": "107",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对、对不起……",
        "nextNodeId": "108"
      },
      "108": {
        "id": "108",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "哈？？这什么节目。",
        "nextNodeId": "109"
      },
      "109": {
        "id": "109",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶！？啊，啊啊！谁打开的……不好好关掉可不行……",
        "nextNodeId": "110"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……电视是我打开的。",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦……这、这样啊…………",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "我不是在看这个节目。",
        "nextNodeId": "113"
      },
      "113": {
        "id": "113",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "114"
      },
      "114": {
        "id": "114",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这、这个也不怎么有趣！……关掉吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "115"
      },
      "115": {
        "id": "115",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不，抱歉。真的……",
        "nextNodeId": "116"
      },
      "116": {
        "id": "116",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "………………变态。",
        "nextNodeId": "117"
      },
      "117": {
        "id": "117",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "118"
      },
      "118": {
        "id": "118",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……怎么办，这杯咖啡。"
      },
      "130": {
        "id": "130",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……？",
        "nextNodeId": "131"
      },
      "131": {
        "id": "131",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不……那杯咖啡是我的……",
        "nextNodeId": "132"
      },
      "132": {
        "id": "132",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……这是我的。你的在桌上吧，那堆文件那里。",
        "nextNodeId": "133"
      },
      "133": {
        "id": "133",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊咧……！",
        "nextNodeId": "134"
      },
      "134": {
        "id": "134",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………你没喝吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "135"
      },
      "135": {
        "id": "135",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………喝、喝了……对不起……",
        "nextNodeId": "136"
      },
      "136": {
        "id": "136",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真、真的对不起！不过円香是喝之前吧！？所以没事……",
        "nextNodeId": "137"
      },
      "137": {
        "id": "137",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "等、円香……？",
        "nextNodeId": "138"
      },
      "138": {
        "id": "138",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "什么？你在慌张是不是和间接接吻了？",
        "nextNodeId": "139"
      },
      "139": {
        "id": "139",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……和这部电视剧的中学生一个水平？永远这么青涩，挺好的。",
        "nextNodeId": "140"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "青春过家家请去别处。",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……果然円香，你还是喝——",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "没喝。在你之后。"
      },
      "160": {
        "id": "160",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……？",
        "nextNodeId": "161"
      },
      "161": {
        "id": "161",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那是円香的吗？抱歉，我以为是我的，喝了一口。",
        "nextNodeId": "162"
      },
      "162": {
        "id": "162",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………哈？",
        "nextNodeId": "163"
      },
      "163": {
        "id": "163",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真的对不起！我马上买一杯一样的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "164"
      },
      "164": {
        "id": "164",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……不要。",
        "nextNodeId": "165"
      },
      "165": {
        "id": "165",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "可是——……",
        "nextNodeId": "166"
      },
      "166": {
        "id": "166",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "不要……我可是买完马上就喝了一口。",
        "nextNodeId": "167"
      },
      "167": {
        "id": "167",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "一点都不好喝，所以再来一杯，反而是麻烦。",
        "nextNodeId": "168"
      },
      "168": {
        "id": "168",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这、这样啊……？可是我害你浪费了，这一点没变……",
        "nextNodeId": "169"
      },
      "169": {
        "id": "169",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我另外赔偿你吧。想喝什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "170"
      },
      "170": {
        "id": "170",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "171"
      },
      "171": {
        "id": "171",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "柠檬茶，微糖。",
        "nextNodeId": "172"
      },
      "172": {
        "id": "172",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "知道了！我马上买来——！",
        "nextNodeId": "173"
      },
      "173": {
        "id": "173",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "174"
      },
      "174": {
        "id": "174",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "为什么这么苦的东西……",
        "nextNodeId": "175"
      },
      "175": {
        "id": "175",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "一点都不好喝的，你一直在喝。",
        "nextNodeId": "176"
      },
      "176": {
        "id": "176",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……无法理解。"
      }
    }
  },
